      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772674172091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deberemos llegar a que T es inyectiva => Nu(T) = {0} => dim Nu(T) = 0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deberemos llegar a que T es inyectiva => Nu(T) = {0} => dim Nu(T) = 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Kmb5m7sQYNE8dFqBfRW0o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2031.668272080196,
      "y": 11708.596997231984,
      "width": 900.5166625976562,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "iTb5MypN4WKrvTeTTGC33",
      "index": "bHA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1875690121,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 2140073223,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674172091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nuevamente planteamos el Teorema de la Dimensión:\n    dim V = dim(Nu(T)) + dim(Im(T))\n    dim V - dim(Im(T)) = dim(Nu(T))\nComo dim V = dim(Im(T)) =>\n    0 = dim(Nu(T))\n=> Nu(T) = {0} => T es inyectiva",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nuevamente planteamos el Teorema de la Dimensión:\n    dim V = dim(Nu(T)) + dim(Im(T))\n    dim V - dim(Im(T)) = dim(Nu(T))\nComo dim V = dim(Im(T)) =>\n    0 = dim(Nu(T))\n=> Nu(T) = {0} => T es inyectiva",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
