    {
      "id": "LTUnWsOf1ECQ2_ZxYlK-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 126.04404425511581,
      "y": 14192.62226470292,
      "width": 842.0999755859375,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJ6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 631929767,
      "version": 279,
      "versionNonce": 38022503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772674392660,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Como lo que pertenece a U forma una base del\nmismo subespacio, que proviene de completar\nla base {v1, ... , vk} con los {u1, ..., un} por ende\nno queda de otra que:\n\n                    bj = 0 ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Como lo que pertenece a U forma una base del\nmismo subespacio, que proviene de completar\nla base {v1, ... , vk} con los {u1, ..., un} por ende\nno queda de otra que:\n\n                    bj = 0 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zH163yzmNRvV2uEjj8ROs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1156.171619202518,
      "y": 14188.298546750015,
      "width": 857.4666748046875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJ7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 299234505,
      "version": 330,
      "versionNonce": 1326227655,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674389095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Como lo que pertenece a W forma una base del\nmismo subespacio, que proviene de completar\nla base {v1, ... , vk} con los {w1, ..., wm} por ende\nno queda de otra que:\n\n                    cl = 0 ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Como lo que pertenece a W forma una base del\nmismo subespacio, que proviene de completar\nla base {v1, ... , vk} con los {w1, ..., wm} por ende\nno queda de otra que:\n\n                    cl = 0 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T0kuojOZg3ca2MXmgmopS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 159.33168704523996,
      "y": 14500.310457592122,
      "width": 1783.0833740234375,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJ8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 136614311,
      "version": 321,
      "versionNonce": 1072352231,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674177110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Finalmente como los v1, ... , vk forman una base de la intersección, entonces necesariamente se cumple:\nai = 0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Finalmente como los v1, ... , vk forman una base de la intersección, entonces necesariamente se cumple:\nai = 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UYpCY3Y9VS8UY7_wXucoc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 156.08338170335503,
      "y": 14640.459360758954,
      "width": 1217.699951171875,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJ9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1645109673,
      "version": 577,
      "versionNonce": 568691209,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674177110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Como ai = bj = cl = 0 => Son L.I =>\n \n    Bu+w = {v1, ..., vk, u1, ..., un, w1, ... , wm} forma una base de U + W\n    => dim(Bu+w) = k + n + m",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Como ai = bj = cl = 0 => Son L.I =>\n \n    Bu+w = {v1, ..., vk, u1, ..., un, w1, ... , wm} forma una base de U + W\n    => dim(Bu+w) = k + n + m",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
