    {
      "id": "Y-TGDacNHm1GOoG9wQ7kq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 146.29003157407527,
      "y": 14877.327022613465,
      "width": 1307.36669921875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1704516905,
      "version": 858,
      "versionNonce": 383270439,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674177110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Y si realizamos las operaciones correspondientes con:\ndim(Bu) = k+n, dim(Bw) = k+m, dim(Bu∩w) = k y las utilizamos para realizar:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Y si realizamos las operaciones correspondientes con:\ndim(Bu) = k+n, dim(Bw) = k+m, dim(Bu∩w) = k y las utilizamos para realizar:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZOYyyZnbchi6MNZSyEC8U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 372.5169407475099,
      "y": 14999.792053597443,
      "width": 769.7333374023438,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9GP-kpsjcEnjK0WBDBrEi",
      "index": "bJD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 24919879,
      "version": 338,
      "versionNonce": 275733449,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772674177110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "dim(U + W) = dim U + dim W - dim(U ∩ W)\ndim(Bu+w) = dim(Bu) + dim(Bw) - dim(Bu∩w)\nk + n + m = (k+n) + (k+m) - k\nk + n + m = k + n + m ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "dim(U + W) = dim U + dim W - dim(U ∩ W)\ndim(Bu+w) = dim(Bu) + dim(Bw) - dim(Bu∩w)\nk + n + m = (k+n) + (k+m) - k\nk + n + m = k + n + m ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sKBhR5X4r-_fI5VP13IM3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405.3496781276782,
      "y": 14853.553320359066,
      "width": 729.933349609375,
      "height": 45,
